    "content" : "Lionel Messi (The GOAT) Biography:\r\n- Full Name: Lionel Andrés Messi\r\n- Birth Date: June 24, 1987\r\n- Birthplace: Rosario, Argentina\r\n- Current Club: Inter Miami (MLS)\r\n\r\nCareer Journey:\r\n- FC Barcelona (2004–2021): Won 34 trophies, 10 La Liga titles, and 4 Champions Leagues.\r\n- Paris Saint-Germain (2021–2023): Won 2 Ligue 1 titles.\r\n- Inter Miami (2023–Present): Won the Leagues Cup.\r\n\r\nInternational Career:\r\n- FIFA World Cup 2022: Champion (Golden Ball winner).\r\n- Copa América 2021: Champion.\r\n- Finalissima 2022: Champion.\r\n- Argentina's all-time leading goalscorer.\r\n\r\nIndividual Records:\r\n- 8 Ballon d'Or awards (World Record).\r\n- 6 European Golden Shoes.\r\n- Most goals scored for a single club (Barcelona - 672 goals).\r\n\r\nPlaying Style:\r\nFamous for low center of gravity, extraordinary dribbling, vision, and playmaking ability. Often considered the greatest football player of all time.",
